WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.397
EAT. A child eats a balanced meal.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.952
MOVE. The child claps and walks using energy.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.251
LIGHT. A torch changes battery energy into light.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.440
SAVE. An unused lamp is switched off.
